# Parity with web source (features/dashboard/widgets/ChargeStatusLiveWidget.tsx)
############################################################
Data sources   : useVehicleState/useCharging → shared LiveDataStore (.signals target),
                 latest charging session energy injected (REST, like the web).
Branches       : compact-charging, full-charging (2x2 grid + tall Rate/Battery row),
                 compact-idle, full-idle + Last Session card, empty "No charge data".
States         : loading · empty · error(retry) · stale(chip+banner) · offline(chip)
                 via LiveStatus/LivePresentation — never a blank panel (ADR-011/013).
i18n           : LocalizedStringKey using the web t() keys 1:1 — widget.chargeStatusLive,
                 widget.noChargeData, widget.notCharging, widget.charging, widget.voltage,
                 widget.amps, widget.timeRemaining, widget.energyAdded, widget.chargeRate,
                 widget.batteryLevel, widget.lastSession. These are the String Catalog
                 extraction keys; physically seeding Localizable.xcstrings is outside the
                 allowed-files scope and is performed by the Xcode build's string
                 extraction (blocked here with the xcodebuild step).
a11y           : VoiceOver labels/values on power, battery, metric cells, badges, last
                 session; SF Symbol decorations accessibilityHidden; Dynamic Type via
                 Font.TS system ramp; pulse honors accessibilityReduceMotion.
Telemetry      : view.opened slug=ChargeStatusLiveWidget (os.Logger) on appear, once.
Registration   : id charge-status-live, default 2x2, min 1x2, max 3x40 (web registry).
Units          : SI on-device; rate converts via shared Units engine at the render
                 boundary; energy always kWh to match the web source.

